title: "Time over noise: Coordination with the unresolved inconsistencies of individual timing (code)"
abstract: >-
  Solver of the synchronous noise model (SNM) and the asynchronous random model
  (ARM) on the distributed graph-colouring problem, the runners that generate
  the simulation datasets, and the analyses that produce every figure and
  supplementary table of the accompanying paper.
